---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'August 18, 2026';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy | Gesture Synth School"
	description="How Gesture Synth School handles your data: what we collect, how we use it, and your choices around cookies, analytics, and advertising."
	canonical="https://gesturesynthschool.com/privacy/"
	ogType="article"
>
	<article class="content container">
		<p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			This policy explains what data Gesture Synth School (the "Site",
			https://gesturesynthschool.com) collects, how it is used, and the choices you
			have. Last updated: {updated}.
		</p>

		<h2>1. The core promise</h2>
		<p>
			The practice tools on this site are built to run in your browser. Your webcam feed,
			the hand gestures it detects, and the songs you practice are processed locally on your
			device — we do not see your camera, your hands, or your practice sessions. No video is
			recorded or transmitted to us.
		</p>

		<h2>2. Information you provide</h2>
		<p>
			Songs you add through the "Add your own song" tool are stored in your browser's local
			storage so they are available the next time you visit. This data stays on your device;
			we cannot access it. Clearing your browser's site data removes it permanently.
		</p>

		<h2>3. Cookies and local storage</h2>
		<p>
			We use browser local storage to remember your settings and your saved songs. We use
			cookies and similar technologies to run analytics and to serve personalized
			advertisements through Google AdSense, as described below.
		</p>

		<h2>4. Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We use Google Analytics (via Google Tag Manager) to understand how visitors use the
			site — for example, which pages are popular and how long people stay. Google Analytics
			collects anonymized usage data and uses cookies to distinguish visitors. You can learn
			more and opt out at
			<a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener"
				>Google's opt-out page</a
			>.
		</p>

		<h2>5. Advertising</h2>
		<p>
			We display ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies to serve
			ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You can personalize or opt out of
			Google's ad cookies at
			<a
				href="https://adssettings.google.com/authenticated"
				rel="noopener"
				>Google Ad Settings</a
			>
			or at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Third-party services</h2>
		<p>
			The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes requests to deliver pages. We link to
			third-party services such as gesturesynth.com, Gesture Synth Weld (hosted on Vercel),
			YouTube, Instagram, and TikTok. Those services have their own privacy policies and are
			not covered by this one.
		</p>

		<h2>7. Children's privacy</h2>
		<p>
			The site is a general-audience resource and does not knowingly collect personal
			information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with
			personal information, contact us using the details below and we will delete it.
		</p>

		<h2>8. Your choices</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Clear saved songs:</strong> use your browser's "clear site data" for
				gesturesynthschool.com.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Analytics:</strong> install the
				<a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener"
					>Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a
				>.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Ads:</strong> manage or disable personalized ads in
				<a href="https://adssettings.google.com/authenticated" rel="noopener"
					>Google Ad Settings</a
				>.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>9. Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Questions about this policy can be sent to
			<a href="mailto:feedback@gesturesynthschool.com"
				>feedback@gesturesynthschool.com</a
			>.
		</p>
	</article>
</Layout>
